                <pb facs="0418" n="336" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg336"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the American Ambassador.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1911-08-16"><hi rendition="#italic">August 16,
                        1911</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The extradition provisions of the Revised Statutes are extended to the Philippine
                    Islands by the act of February 6, 1905, Statutes at Large, volume 33, page 698;
                    it provides that extradition to and from the islands shall be made pursuant to
                    provisions of regular extradition treaties between the United States and other
                    countries.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Knox.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
